     "description": "Established in 1876 in St. Louis, Missouri, this brand has evolved into an iconic global symbol of American-style pale lager. It is recognized for its commitment to consistency and quality, maintaining its status as a staple choice for social gatherings and sporting events worldwide. Currently under the ownership of AB InBev, the brand balances a rich historical legacy with a vast distribution network that makes it ubiquitous in the beverage market. Its positioning emphasizes accessibility and communal enjoyment, appealing to a wide demographic of adults.",
