       "language": "en_au",
       "value": "Budweiser Light"
      }
     ],
     "description": "Bud Light is a leading American light lager renowned for its crisp, clean taste and status as a staple for social occasions. Since its introduction in 1982, the brand has maintained a strong presence through massive sports partnerships and consistent messaging centered on enjoyment and ease. It is owned by Anheuser-Busch and serves as a primary choice for millions of consumers seeking an affordable, refreshing beer. The brand is deeply ingrained in the American cultural landscape, particularly within the contexts of sports and communal celebration.",
